neotrickle (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging for the modern neotrickle implementation.
  * Installs canonical trickle/trickled commands with optional aliases.
  * Keeps classic command names but not classic CLI/config/protocol
    compatibility; see /usr/share/doc/trickle/NEWS.Debian.gz and
    /usr/share/doc/trickle/migration-classic.md.

